% tokens (closed-world sort checking)
t: type.
probe: type.
seen: type.
gone: type.

% till read-starvation fixture (E7.2, round-13 testing residue iv): one
% token t, a reader and a consumer tied at the same activation. The consumer
% would starve the read of its last copy, so the order is observable and
% explore must branch: take-first kills look ({gone, probe}), look-first
% preserves t for take ({seen, gone}).

look: read t * probe -o { seen }.
take: t -o { gone }.
